                "dsDescriptionValue": {
                  "typeName": "dsDescriptionValue",
                  "multiple": false,
                  "typeClass": "primitive",
                  "value": "<table><tr><td><p dir=\"ltr\"><i>This tool is used when R&R or certain aspects of R&R need to be evaluated after some time passed after their introduction. The evaluation looks into the reception and (perceived) success of these policies and will provide recommendations on what needs to change and how based on what was collected by the different methods. </i><i>The tool is a comprehensive guide to effectively plan and execute an evaluation.</i></p></td></tr></table><p></p>"
                }
              }
